<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="dark">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>findex — search DSA problems by meaning & technique</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Search competitive programming & DSA problems by keyword, meaning, or deep technique." />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="terminal-container">
      <!-- Header -->
      <header class="term-header">
        <div class="term-brand">
          <div class="terminal-dots">
            <span class="dot dot-red"></span>
            <span class="dot dot-yellow"></span>
            <span class="dot dot-green"></span>
          </div>
          <h1 class="logo-title">
            <svg class="brand-svg" viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">
              <polyline points="20,20 50,50 20,80" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="12" stroke-linejoin="miter"></polyline>
              <rect x="60" y="32" width="16" height="36" fill="var(--accent)"></rect>
            </svg>
            findex
            <span class="term-ver">v1.2</span>
          </h1>
        </div>

        <nav class="term-nav">
          <button type="button" id="theme-toggle" class="btn-term-sm">
            <span id="theme-icon">☼</span> <span id="theme-text">light mode</span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" id="scrape-btn" class="btn-term-sm btn-accent" title="Fetch live problems from LeetCode and Codeforces">
            ⟳ sync / scrape
          </button>
          <button type="button" id="help-btn" class="btn-term-sm" title="Show manual">
            :help
          </button>
        </nav>
      </header>

      <!-- Tagline & Stats Banner -->
      <div class="term-tagline">
        <span class="tagline-text">
          <span id="total-count"><%= totalProblems %></span> competitive programming problems · LeetCode, Codeforces, CSES, AtCoder · <code>:help</code> for manual
        </span>
      </div>

      <!-- Search Command Line Interface -->
      <form id="search-form" class="search-form" autocomplete="off">
        <div class="search-bar-wrap">
          <span class="search-prompt">$ findex</span>
          <input
            id="search-input"
            type="search"
            placeholder="thief robbing houses / aliens trick / course cycle / knapsack"
            autocomplete="off"
            spellcheck="false"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="search-controls">
          <select id="mode-select" class="select-term" title="Ranking Algorithm Mode">
            <option value="keyword">keyword · bm25</option>
            <option value="meaning">meaning · semantic</option>
            <option value="both">both · hybrid</option>
          </select>

          <select id="judge-select" class="select-term" title="Filter by Online Judge">
            <option value="all">all judges</option>
            <option value="leetcode">LeetCode</option>
            <option value="codeforces">Codeforces</option>
            <option value="cses">CSES</option>
            <option value="atcoder">AtCoder</option>
          </select>

          <button type="submit" id="submit-btn" class="btn-submit">
            search ↵
          </button>
        </div>
      </form>

      <!-- Terminal Shell Prompt & Library Bar -->
      <div class="shell-bar">
        <div class="shell-path">
          <span class="shell-host">findex:</span><span id="shell-cwd" class="shell-dir">~</span><span class="shell-cursor">$</span>
        </div>
        <div class="shell-chips">
          <button type="button" class="chip-cmd" data-cmd=":bookmarks">
            ★ <span id="bookmarks-count">0</span> bookmarks
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="chip-cmd" data-cmd=":done">
            ✓ <span id="done-count">0</span> done
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="chip-cmd" data-cmd=":all">
            :ls all
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="chip-cmd" data-cmd=":clear">
            ↺ reset
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Mode Options & Compare Row -->
      <div class="options-row">
        <label class="toggle-label" title="Run keyword vs semantic search side-by-side">
          <input type="checkbox" id="compare-toggle" />
          <span class="toggle-text">compare keyword / meaning</span>
        </label>

        <div class="popular-patterns">
          <span class="pattern-lbl">patterns:</span>
          <button type="button" class="pat-badge" data-pattern="dynamic-programming">#dynamic-programming</button>
          <button type="button" class="pat-badge" data-pattern="wqs-binary-search">#wqs-binary-search</button>
          <button type="button" class="pat-badge" data-pattern="segment-tree">#segment-tree</button>
          <button type="button" class="pat-badge" data-pattern="topological-sort">#topological-sort</button>
          <button type="button" class="pat-badge" data-pattern="two-pointers">#two-pointers</button>
          <button type="button" class="pat-badge" data-pattern="tree-dp">#tree-dp</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Filter Active Pill -->
      <div id="filter-pill-wrap" class="filter-pill-wrap hidden">
        <span class="active-filter-label">Filter:</span>
        <span id="active-filter-text" class="active-filter-chip"></span>
        <button type="button" id="clear-filter" class="btn-clear-filter">✕ clear</button>
      </div>

      <!-- Status & Engine Latency Indicator -->
      <div id="status-line" class="status-line">
        <span id="status-text">ready</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Help / Modal Manual -->
      <div id="help-modal" class="help-box hidden">
        <div class="help-header">
          <span>MANUAL(1) — findex search engine</span>
          <button type="button" id="close-help" class="close-help">✕</button>
        </div>
        <pre class="help-content">
NAME
     findex — smart problem search engine for LeetCode, Codeforces, CSES & AtCoder

SYNOPSIS
     findex [query] [--mode=keyword|meaning|both] [--judge=all|leetcode|codeforces]

SEARCH MODES
     keyword      BM25/TF-IDF word matching across titles, tags, and statements.
     meaning      Plain-English concept & alias search (e.g. "thief robbing", "aliens trick").
     both         Hybrid weighted combination of keyword + semantic score.

SPECIAL COMMANDS
     :bookmarks   Show starred problems
     :done        Show solved / marked done problems
     :all         List all indexed problems
     :help        Display this manual
     :scrape      Trigger live problem scraper from LeetCode & Codeforces APIs

FEATURES
     • Find Similar: Click [≈ similar] on any card to find nearest pattern neighbors.
     • Compare Mode: Toggle "compare keyword / meaning" to evaluate rankers side by side.
        </pre>
      </div>

      <!-- Single Search Results Grid -->
      <div id="results-view" class="results-view">
        <div id="results-list" class="results-list"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Compare Grid (Side by Side) -->
      <div id="compare-view" class="compare-grid hidden">
        <div class="compare-col">
          <div class="compare-col-header">
            <h3>Keyword Ranker (BM25)</h3>
            <span id="kw-latency" class="col-latency"></span>
          </div>
          <div id="kw-results" class="results-list"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="compare-col">
          <div class="compare-col-header">
            <h3>Meaning Ranker (Semantic)</h3>
            <span id="meaning-latency" class="col-latency"></span>
          </div>
          <div id="meaning-results" class="results-list"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Footer -->
      <footer class="term-footer">
        <span>findex v1.2 · LeetCode · Codeforces · CSES · AtCoder · <a href="https://github.com/sushil-kumar-saw/Findex" target="_blank">github</a></span>
      </footer>
    </div>

    <script src="/app.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
